<description>&lt;p&gt;Sudanese armed forces carried out a drone strike on Abyei’s Amiet market, killing dozens and injuring many, prompting South Sudan to summon Sudan’s envoy over the attack. A separate drone strike in the disputed Sudan-South Sudan border region also caused high casualties. In Ruweng, fresh attacks left nine dead and six wounded, while in Northern Bahr el Ghazal bodies arrived from Khor Kaltan killings. Communal clashes continued, including 14 deaths between Warrap and Lakes communities and a traditional chief’s arrest over a Juba youth killing. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxPbVJQNGViaFJPaXk4YTZJVHh2OU84dTdpa1pKTEt0T181Tk5wQ0ZrNkRyT2FOTXZRdmpPa2J2elIxYWRlck5fNXBJcVJLVHBsYjAxREs5SXI2Q191OHpwSm5KeDY0VkNCQUlzbWxtUXZHY3RDbVBBaGpsVDFtOTV1TVZfakVzQ3JMWUl3anFsSjQ1bUplTzRUVTIycUlSMkxJb2JPTkJqWGtMdzVQczdGWHU1aFMwX3JhSDExdA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Media Line&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTE9BLS1yVklXMG5XeDFDSFdNbzNpd3c4Q2RyVjFGcTZZS2ZWZ0NtYnN5emhicjVtRTlzTDZ4RG52M0RVSERzcEExRHk2ZjYwTzJ3OTA1SUc3UUFqNU5GYTFF?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Internazionale&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxQQTVERTRkS1RsUm1JTFlUWEFZelk4ckVtS25ybVU0c2pyY0I0Q1N1OTUtUjJMaFVxUk9HR00tNHJaQ2h6UlMyQ1dNbXJncTFnNUV5ZlpadFFwbVI4aHhkWDJzdW5JaUZuM0dLN3o5NFJKbWZYbUpaQnc1SV9PdmRScFVTa1ZvbTBEM3FwZjFhakVOY01YUVdjQzZTdDB5c054RDBv?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Tamazuj&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxOQVcyRThDcDFBVkxaUmpmc2djOFhZMEhRaW0wYVpjbWc4UndVbVd6b0ZIRDMwQmowRV83TjdvSGcyNkxPdHAtODd1dHlfVjJRQ